# Third-party code

`src/hybris/preprocessS1.py` is adapted from the `python-api` folder of
[gee_s1_ard](https://github.com/adugnag/gee_s1_ard) by Adugna Mullissa et al.,
used here under the MIT License.

See the methodology in:
Mullissa, A., et al. (2021). Sentinel-1 SAR Backscatter Analysis Ready Data
Preparation in Google Earth Engine. Remote Sensing, 13(10), 1954.
https://doi.org/10.3390/rs13101954

